        <activityName xml:lang="en">Photovoltaic laminate, CdTe, mix, at regional storage</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Photovoltaic laminate, CdTe, mix, at regional storage
Estimation for photovoltaic CdTe modules used in Europe. Mix of First Solar Series 4 and Series 6 modules produced in Malaysia and the US.;
Synonyms: Solarmodul, PV-module, cadmium telluride, thin film; 
UUID: 8fd52753-d670-3d4f-b313-2f89979af453
Production mix for use in Europe. Transport of modules from overseas.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: None
Time period: Data refer to 2018.
Production volume: 2600 MW total production by First Solar in 2018.
Sampling: Producer information 
Extrapolations: None
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_8fd52753-d670-3d4f-b313-2f89979af453.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
